ants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Mediterranean, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","review_id":"H-b0SUTRiz2jWTlc2nasyQ","date":"2020-04-23T16:48:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9347670078277588,"text_excerpt":"I love going here when we get a chance. The food is fresh, tasty, & (I think) very healthy. The space is cute; it doesn't feel pretentious. The staff are always friendly. They are probably the most vegan-friendly places I'm aware of in New Orlean. They have smoothies, juices, coffee, avocado toast, healthy bowls, curries, etc."},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","review_id":"bTiZrBVs58KRPbJfPLlrtg","date":"2019-11-02T07:08:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9289451837539673,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Adventurous beverages offered with your choice of numerous alt milks. The Good Karma plate is my go to: Curry and rice, served with generous salad, hot lentil soup and perfect papadum. It's not cheap but it's fresh quality food and very filling. They have baked goods and offer a small selection of seasonal produce. I was so happy to find my first persimmon of the season here. They support local makers by selling locally made body care products and art too. The interior is bright and welcoming, but it is tiny. When it's busy, you might need to join a community table. One of my favorite features is that they are low waste! No plastic anywhere to be seen. Thank you for feedi..."},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","review_id":"Eoljv85TspP5qeAV69fN2w","date":"2017-02-17T00:57:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9243351221084595,"text_excerpt":"Great place for vegan food, desserts, smoothies, juices and coffee. You will not miss eating meat if you come here, everything is just full of flavor. Prices are reasonable and you won't feel guilty afterwards because everything is healthy and made fresh! It is connected to a yoga studio, so immediately when you walk in, there is a feeling of peace that washes over you. Very laid back vibe."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","photo_id":"cZidSNZ74JWOSvBblJqukg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/cZidSNZ74JWOSvBblJqukg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8567545413970947},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","photo_id":"8GK5bq90I-olBulF5Df3Fg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8GK5bq90I-olBulF5Df3Fg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8465147018432617},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","photo_id":"FI3PtDQYDESp4seV85nUtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FI3PtDQYDESp4seV85nUtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8283827900886536},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","photo_id":"KTeIDJ0-ubk8f5UvbVoR6g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/KTeIDJ0-ubk8f5UvbVoR6g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7988746762275696},{"business_id":"2EOinQpyU4ChpyJ4KusO2A","photo_id":"wAvn_UtgGXNB77s